### 1. Linter Failures (Unused Imports)
*   **Feedback**: Unused imports (`resolveToRealPath`, `isSubpath`, `resolveExecutable`, `isTrustedSystemPath`) were causing ESLint to fail on `packages/core/src/tools/ripGrep.ts`.
